        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A cozy game about transcending over the regular life hustles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts with one wood...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/2f9dbff4277017a02fe5a14f50fd1be5.poster.avif?t=1765227859\" width=1026 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/2f9dbff4277017a02fe5a14f50fd1be5.webm?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/2f9dbff4277017a02fe5a14f50fd1be5.mp4?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to gather and to grind you need willpower and that doesn't come out of thin air. You go and sleep on the bench to restore your willpower. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/725a7f4dbb55c929bb0209bfe67c4ee7.poster.avif?t=1765227859\" width=1026 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/725a7f4dbb55c929bb0209bfe67c4ee7.webm?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/725a7f4dbb55c929bb0209bfe67c4ee7.mp4?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also no trees? No problem, sleeping will recover the resources and make the pumpkins grow. Beware not all resources grew in one day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You collect and collect, again and again until... well until you can't hold any more of it. Then you open the  storage, to collect more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/9e54f96f469a73b9a0a530ecf8c2acb3.poster.avif?t=1765227859\" width=1026 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/9e54f96f469a73b9a0a530ecf8c2acb3.webm?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/9e54f96f469a73b9a0a530ecf8c2acb3.mp4?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it just one resource is not enough. You need more for your cult...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/1120516bafe99c9ab43681e9319486e0.poster.avif?t=1765227859\" width=1026 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/1120516bafe99c9ab43681e9319486e0.webm?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/1120516bafe99c9ab43681e9319486e0.mp4?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you have some building blocks at the cost of sleeping on the bench for days (Shhh... don't look at the day in the recording. Developer has access to cheat tools... :( Hacking dev!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/82868e9ab277269538a4bcdfbad4a160.poster.avif?t=1765227859\" width=1026 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/82868e9ab277269538a4bcdfbad4a160.webm?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/82868e9ab277269538a4bcdfbad4a160.mp4?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it is time to plant some pumpkins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/a39f9a422ed9eb57519ba88807cd6fdc.poster.avif?t=1765227859\" width=1026 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/a39f9a422ed9eb57519ba88807cd6fdc.webm?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/a39f9a422ed9eb57519ba88807cd6fdc.mp4?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Tense music!]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it is time to summon some souls...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/8faf201cc816db5a2988cec646152b53.poster.avif?t=1765227859\" width=1026 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/8faf201cc816db5a2988cec646152b53.webm?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/8faf201cc816db5a2988cec646152b53.mp4?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOOO!! Now you have lovely pumpkin spice souls! It is time to turn them into latt... sacrifices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/736a49f1a32ccef8b079ecf028cc7331.poster.avif?t=1765227859\" width=1026 height=800 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/736a49f1a32ccef8b079ecf028cc7331.webm?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/736a49f1a32ccef8b079ecf028cc7331.mp4?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally it is time to leave everything behind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/d268e15b00359d92c88dc9bfc5e94b0b.poster.avif?t=1765227859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/d268e15b00359d92c88dc9bfc5e94b0b.webm?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132440/extras/d268e15b00359d92c88dc9bfc5e94b0b.mp4?t=1765227859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CULTivation is a minimalist farming-sim where you can sit back, relax and enjoy the numbers go up.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can keep going after the 666 mark but when it comes to games like this, I love to have an end goal with a lovely ending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you will have fun with this little project of ours!</p>",
